Hi Mike,

Sorry for another naive question. I guess I didn't have a good understanding for "rainact"

When I set the rainact=1 and actrainthresh = 0.1, it's meaning the animal's activity will be limited if rainfall reached 0.1m? or animal will become active when rainfall reached 0.1m? Now I guess the later will be right?

the same code, I found when rainact=1 and actrainthresh = 0.1, the max TC will be higher but when arrived the higher TC, ACT=0 and solar=0.

maybe the rainact=1 usually be used for amphibian/ or some reptiles rely on rainfall ?  the higher TC, but ACT and solar =0  due to no rainfall and animal retreat to the underground, but the surface will be hot,  so it have higher TC?

Best wishes,

